IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ita-tax`

-- Income Tax Act 1947, ss 2, 13(7A), 38, 39, 39A, 40B, 42, 42A, 43(1)(b) and Second Schedule Table 3 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_income-tax-act-1947_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- resident in Singapore`

`a citizen living here all year` MEANS `Residence facts` WITH
    `I resided in Singapore in the preceding year apart from reasonable temporary absences` IS TRUE
    `days I was physically present in Singapore in the preceding year` IS 365
    `days I exercised an employment in Singapore in the preceding year other than as a director` IS 0

`a visitor here 182 days` MEANS `Residence facts` WITH
    `I resided in Singapore in the preceding year apart from reasonable temporary absences` IS FALSE
    `days I was physically present in Singapore in the preceding year` IS 182
    `days I exercised an employment in Singapore in the preceding year other than as a director` IS 0

`a visitor here 183 days` MEANS `Residence facts` WITH
    `I resided in Singapore in the preceding year apart from reasonable temporary absences` IS FALSE
    `days I was physically present in Singapore in the preceding year` IS 183
    `days I exercised an employment in Singapore in the preceding year other than as a director` IS 0

`a foreign director here 90 days` MEANS `Residence facts` WITH
    `I resided in Singapore in the preceding year apart from reasonable temporary absences` IS FALSE
    `days I was physically present in Singapore in the preceding year` IS 90
    `days I exercised an employment in Singapore in the preceding year other than as a director` IS 0

#ASSERT `Am I resident in Singapore` `a citizen living here all year`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I resident in Singapore` `a visitor here 182 days`
#ASSERT `Am I resident in Singapore` `a visitor here 183 days`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I resident in Singapore` `a foreign director here 90 days`

