§ `s 40B -- relief for a non-resident employee`

`a non-resident engineer with only employment income` MEANS `Non-resident employment facts` WITH
    `the year of assessment` IS 2025
    `I am a director of a company` IS FALSE
    `I have an SRS withdrawal or public entertainer income` IS FALSE
    `my only source of income in Singapore is my employment` IS TRUE
    `my statutory income from the employment` IS 100000
    `my total assessable income` IS 100000
    `my chargeable income` IS 100000
    `the chargeable income a resident would have in the same circumstances` IS 100000

`a non-resident executive earning a million` MEANS `Non-resident employment facts` WITH
    `the year of assessment` IS 2025
    `I am a director of a company` IS FALSE
    `I have an SRS withdrawal or public entertainer income` IS FALSE
    `my only source of income in Singapore is my employment` IS TRUE
    `my statutory income from the employment` IS 1000000
    `my total assessable income` IS 1000000
    `my chargeable income` IS 1000000
    `the chargeable income a resident would have in the same circumstances` IS 1000000

`a non-resident employee who also lets a flat` MEANS `Non-resident employment facts` WITH
    `the year of assessment` IS 2025
    `I am a director of a company` IS FALSE
    `I have an SRS withdrawal or public entertainer income` IS FALSE
    `my only source of income in Singapore is my employment` IS FALSE
    `my statutory income from the employment` IS 60000
    `my total assessable income` IS 100000
    `my chargeable income` IS 90000
    `the chargeable income a resident would have in the same circumstances` IS 90000

`a non-resident director` MEANS `Non-resident employment facts` WITH
    `the year of assessment` IS 2025
    `I am a director of a company` IS TRUE
    `I have an SRS withdrawal or public entertainer income` IS FALSE
    `my only source of income in Singapore is my employment` IS TRUE
    `my statutory income from the employment` IS 100000
    `my total assessable income` IS 100000
    `my chargeable income` IS 100000
    `the chargeable income a resident would have in the same circumstances` IS 100000

#ASSERT `What is my tax as a non-resident employee` `a non-resident engineer with only employment income` EQUALS JUST 15000
#ASSERT `What is my tax as a non-resident employee` `a non-resident executive earning a million` EQUALS JUST 199150
#ASSERT `What is my tax as a non-resident employee` `a non-resident employee who also lets a flat` EQUALS JUST 16740
#ASSERT `What is my tax as a non-resident employee` `a non-resident director` EQUALS JUST 24000

